  "rationale": "Disclosed diagnostic after demand-construction runs. All 16 resource overlays retained. Canonicalize each abstract resource to min(r_i,t*max_action_consumption_i). This preserves finite-horizon feasibility for fixed nonnegative consumption and Boolean goals. Counts and matching share canonicalization. 50000-node matching is a separately labelled cost sensitivity run, not substituted into the 5000-node main results. No external/API reruns."
